Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: python/libxml.c
Line: 2426
Function: libxml_last
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: cur is obtained via PyxmlNode_Get(obj) and dereferenced (cur->type) without checking for NULL. A bad Python object causing PyxmlNode_Get to return NULL will trigger a crash.

Source context:
